{{#> section}}
  <h1 class="text-orange-500 text-3xl" class="text-orange-500 text-3xl">
    What is NestJS
  </h1>
  <p class="text-slate-100">
    Nest is a backend framework that makes it easier to build website backends.
    It comes with a cli tool that makes starting and managing projects a breeze.
    Because Nest enforces a strict code structure it ensures that your application stays modular and organized.
  </p>
{{/section}}

